1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:03,400
[♪♪♪]

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,160
I'm Peppa Pig.
[SNORTS]

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,960
This is my little brother,
George.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,160
[GRUNTS]

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,400
This is Mommy Pig.

6
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,559
[SNORTS]

7
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:11,840
And this is Daddy Pig.

8
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,280
[GRUNTS]
[ALL LAUGHING]

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,760
Peppa Pig.
[GRUNTS]

10
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,960
[♪♪♪]

11
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,959
[PEPPA READS ONSCREEN TEXT]

12
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,840
NARRATOR:
It is raining today,

13
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,759
So, Peppa and George
cannot play outside.

14
00:00:33,879 --> 00:00:36,519
[SNORTS]
Daddy, it stopped raining.

15
00:00:36,519 --> 00:00:38,440
Can we go out to play?

16
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:41,600
Ha, ha. All right,
run along, you two.

17
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,680
[BOTH SNORT, LAUGHING]

18
00:00:45,239 --> 00:00:47,440
[♪♪♪]

19
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,040
[SPLASHES]

20
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:54,519
NARRATOR:
Peppa loves jumping
in muddy puddles!

21
00:00:54,519 --> 00:00:57,160
[GRUNTS]
I love muddy puddles.

22
00:00:57,160 --> 00:01:00,279
[LAUGHS]

23
00:01:00,279 --> 00:01:02,519
[SNORTS]
MOMMY PIG: Peppa!

24
00:01:02,519 --> 00:01:04,080
If you jump
in muddy puddles,

25
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:06,600
you must
wear your boots.

26
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,640
Sorry, Mommy.

27
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,720
[♪♪♪]

28
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:17,440
[GIGGLES]

29
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:20,000
NARRATOR:
George likes to jump
in muddy puddles too.

30
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,240
[SPLASHING]

31
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,399
[GRUNTS]

32
00:01:22,399 --> 00:01:23,679
George!

33
00:01:23,679 --> 00:01:25,640
If you jump
in muddy puddles,

34
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:28,080
you must wear your boots!

35
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:33,479
NARRATOR:
Peppa likes to look after
her little brother, George.

36
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,280
[♪♪♪]

37
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:39,280
[GIGGLING, GRUNTING]

38
00:01:41,679 --> 00:01:44,880
George, let's find
some more puddles.

39
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:47,280
[♪♪♪]

40
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:51,360
[SPLASHING, LAUGHING]

41
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:54,960
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George
are having a lot of fun.

42
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,479
Peppa has found
a little puddle.

43
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:57,640
[SLOSHES]

44
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,839
George has found
a big puddle.

45
00:01:59,839 --> 00:02:01,880
[SLOSHING]

46
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,919
[BOTH SLOSHING]

47
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,039
[BOTH PANTING]

48
00:02:09,079 --> 00:02:10,239
[GIGGLES]

49
00:02:10,239 --> 00:02:12,600
Look, George!

50
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,640
There's a really
big puddle!

51
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:22,040
NARRATOR:
George wants to jump into
the big puddle first.

52
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,600
Stop, George!

53
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:26,120
I must check if
it's safe for you.

54
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,880
[SLOSHES]

55
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:31,239
Good! It is
safe for you.

56
00:02:31,239 --> 00:02:35,959
[CRYING]

57
00:02:35,959 --> 00:02:39,400
Sorry, George.
It's only mud.

58
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,359
[LAUGHS]

59
00:02:41,359 --> 00:02:42,680
[SLOSHES]

60
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:46,959
[GRUNTING, LAUGHING]

61
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:52,160
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George love jumping
in muddy puddles.

62
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:54,239
[SLOSHING]

63
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,560
[SNORTS]
Come on, George!

64
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,640
Let's go and show Daddy!

65
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,760
[♪♪♪]

66
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:05,840
[GIGGLING]

67
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,799
[SNORTS]
Goodness me!

68
00:03:09,799 --> 00:03:11,160
Daddy! Daddy!

69
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:13,600
Guess what
we've been doing?

70
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:17,480
Let me think... Have you been
watching television?

71
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:20,239
No, no, Daddy.

72
00:03:20,239 --> 00:03:21,920
Have you just
had a bath?

73
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:26,280
[BOTH LAUGH]
No! No!

74
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,239
I know!

75
00:03:28,239 --> 00:03:31,079
You've been jumping
in muddy puddles!

76
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:32,720
Yes, yes, Daddy!

77
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:35,239
We've been jumping
in muddy puddles!

78
00:03:35,239 --> 00:03:38,720
Ho, ho. And look at
the mess you're in.

79
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,720
Ooh.

80
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:43,840
Oh, well,
it's only mud.

81
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:46,959
Let's clean up quickly,
before Mommy sees the mess.

82
00:03:49,119 --> 00:03:51,519
Daddy, when
we've cleaned up,

83
00:03:51,519 --> 00:03:54,359
will you and Mommy
come and play too?

84
00:03:54,359 --> 00:03:57,679
Yes, we can all
play in the garden.

85
00:03:57,679 --> 00:03:59,880
[♪♪♪]

86
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,720
[PEPPA &amp; GEORGE GIGGLING]

87
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:06,799
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George
are wearing their boots.

88
00:04:06,799 --> 00:04:08,920
Mommy and Daddy
are wearing their boots.

89
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:12,679
NARRATOR:
Peppa loves jumping up and down
in muddy puddles.

90
00:04:12,679 --> 00:04:14,239
[LAUGHING]

91
00:04:14,239 --> 00:04:17,079
Everyone loves jumping up
and down in muddy puddles.

92
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:19,719
[SPLASHING, LAUGHING]

93
00:04:19,719 --> 00:04:21,920
[♪♪♪]

94
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,880
[ALL GASP]

95
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:29,880
Oh, Daddy Pig,
look at the mess you're in.

96
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:32,120
It's only mud.

97
00:04:33,599 --> 00:04:36,360
[GRUNTS, LAUGHS]

98
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,680
[♪♪♪]

99
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:41,719
[ALL LAUGHING]

100
00:04:46,919 --> 00:04:48,200
[BIRDS TWEETING]

101
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:51,960
[♪♪♪]

102
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:54,520
[PEPPA READS ONSCREEN TEXT]

103
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:01,440
NARRATOR:
George's favorite toy
is Mr. Dinosaur.

104
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,400
[GRUNTS]
Dine-Saw!

105
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,640
[GIGGLES]

106
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,479
NARRATOR:
George loves Mr. Dinosaur.

107
00:05:06,479 --> 00:05:09,159
Grrr!
[LAUGHS, GRUNTS]

108
00:05:09,159 --> 00:05:12,880
NARRATOR:
Sometimes George likes to scare
Peppa with Mr. Dinosaur.

109
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,560
Grrr!
Eeek! Too scary!

110
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,640
[LAUGHING]

111
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:25,120
NARRATOR:
At suppertime, Mr. Dinosaur
sits next to George.

112
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:28,400
[BURPS]
MOMMY PIG: I beg your pardon!

113
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:31,479
Was that you, George,
or was it Mr. Dinosaur?

114
00:05:31,479 --> 00:05:33,880
Dine-Saw!
[BURPS]

115
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:37,000
[ALL LAUGH]

116
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:40,120
NARRATOR:
At bath time, George shares
his bath with Mr. Dinosaur.

117
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,440
[BUBBLES POP]
Grr!

118
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,479
Tee-hee-hee.
[GRUNTS]

119
00:05:45,359 --> 00:05:47,039
Good night, Peppa.
[SNORTS]

120
00:05:47,039 --> 00:05:48,880
Good night, Mommy!
[SNORTS]

121
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:50,159
Good night, George.

122
00:05:50,159 --> 00:05:52,280
And good night,
Mr. Dinosaur.

123
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,919
[GRUNTS]
Grr!

124
00:05:53,919 --> 00:05:55,440
NARRATOR:
When George goes to bed,

125
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:57,960
Mr. Dinosaur
is tucked up with him.

126
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:02,719
[♪♪♪]

127
00:06:02,719 --> 00:06:04,560
NARRATOR:
George's favorite game

128
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,599
is throwing Mr. Dinosaur
up in the air...

129
00:06:06,599 --> 00:06:08,320
Whee!

130
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:10,919
NARRATOR:
...and catching him
when he falls back down.

131
00:06:10,919 --> 00:06:13,760
Whee!
[GIGGLES, SNORTS]

132
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:16,800
Wee!
[GIGGLES, SNORTS]

133
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,479
Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!

134
00:06:18,479 --> 00:06:21,760
NARRATOR:
Peppa and Daddy Pig
are playing draughts.

135
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,440
[LAUGHING]

136
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,200
I win, Daddy!
Ha, ha!

137
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,080
Oh. Well done, Peppa.

138
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:31,320
[CRYING]
George?

139
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:33,799
[CONTINUES CRYING]

140
00:06:33,799 --> 00:06:35,599
George, what's the matter?

141
00:06:35,599 --> 00:06:37,799
Dine-Saw...

142
00:06:37,799 --> 00:06:41,240
George, have you lost
Mr. Dinosaur?

143
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,560
[GRUNTS]

144
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:45,080
NARRATOR:
George has lost Mr. Dinosaur.

145
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,520
MOMMY PIG:
Don't worry, George.

146
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:48,560
We'll find Mr. Dinosaur.

147
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:51,039
It's a job for a detective.

148
00:06:51,039 --> 00:06:54,719
Daddy, what is
a de-tech-tiff?

149
00:06:54,719 --> 00:06:56,400
A detective

150
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,159
is a very
important person,

151
00:06:58,159 --> 00:07:00,640
who is good
at finding things.

152
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:03,440
Me! Me!
I'm good at finding things!

153
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:04,680
All right!

154
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:07,599
Peppa is the detective!

155
00:07:07,599 --> 00:07:10,080
George. I am
the de-tech-tiff,

156
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:15,000
[GRUNTS]
I will help you find
Mr. Dinosaur.

157
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:19,320
Maybe the detective should ask
George some simple questions.

158
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:23,200
George?
Where's Mr. Dinosaur?

159
00:07:24,239 --> 00:07:25,880
[SOBS]

160
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:28,599
NARRATOR:
George does not know
where Mr. Dinosaur is.

161
00:07:28,599 --> 00:07:31,039
The detective could try
and guess where

162
00:07:31,039 --> 00:07:32,840
Mr. Dinosaur might be.

163
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:35,080
I know!
I know where he is!

164
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:37,680
[GRUNTS, GIGGLES]

165
00:07:39,239 --> 00:07:43,479
George always has Mr. Dinosaur
with him in the bath.

166
00:07:43,479 --> 00:07:46,080
So Mr. Dinosaur
is in the bath!

167
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:48,520
NARRATOR:
Mr. Dinosaur
is not in the bath.

168
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,840
Oh. I know!

169
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:54,359
I know where
Mr. Dinosaur is! Hee-hee!

170
00:07:54,359 --> 00:07:58,440
George always has Mr. Dinosaur
in his bed at night.

171
00:07:58,440 --> 00:08:01,440
[GRUNTS]
So that's where he is!

172
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:03,919
NARRATOR:
Mr. Dinosaur is not
in George's bed.

173
00:08:03,919 --> 00:08:05,400
Oh.

174
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:08,039
Maybe we should try
the garden.

175
00:08:08,039 --> 00:08:09,840
Yes, the garden!

176
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:12,560
[SNORTS]
I was going to say that!

177
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,760
[♪♪♪]

178
00:08:16,679 --> 00:08:19,200
Where is Mr. Dinosaur?

179
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:22,200
NARRATOR:
Mr. Dinosaur
is very hard to find.

180
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:27,000
Oh... Mr. Dinosaur
isn't anywhere!

181
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,320
George?

182
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:32,840
You do love to throw
Mr. Dinosaur in the air.

183
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:34,280
I wonder if this time

184
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:37,280
you threw Mr. Dinosaur
just a bit too high.

185
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,959
PEPPA:
There he is! There he is!

186
00:08:39,959 --> 00:08:42,959
I saw him first!
[GRUNTS]

187
00:08:42,959 --> 00:08:44,840
Well done, Peppa!

188
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,520
You really are
a very good detective!

189
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:48,760
[GRUNTS]

190
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:51,840
[GIGGLING]

191
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,720
[SNORTS]
Dine-Saw.

192
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,680
Grr!

193
00:08:56,680 --> 00:09:00,360
NARRATOR:
George is so happy to have
Mr. Dinosaur back again.

194
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:03,040
Whee!
[BRANCHES RUSTLE]

195
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,319
[WHIMPERING]

196
00:09:04,319 --> 00:09:06,280
Maybe it isn't
a good idea

197
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,520
to play with dinosaurs
near trees.

198
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:10,520
[GIGGLES]

199
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:13,920
[ALL LAUGH]

200
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,880
Dine-Saw!
[GRUNTS]

201
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,959
[♪♪♪]

202
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:24,880
[PEPPA READS ONSCREEN TEXT]

203
00:09:29,079 --> 00:09:33,400
NARRATOR:
Peppa is waiting for
her best friend, Suzy Sheep.

204
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,439
[DOORBELL RINGS]

205
00:09:35,439 --> 00:09:37,959
[♪♪♪]

206
00:09:37,959 --> 00:09:39,640
[GRUNTS]
Hello, Suzy!

207
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,680
Baa! Hello, Peppa.

208
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:44,120
NARRATOR:
Suzy Sheep has come to play
with Peppa.

209
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,199
[BOTH GIGGLING]

210
00:09:45,199 --> 00:09:47,120
[GRUNTS]
[BLEATS]

211
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:49,319
NARRATOR:
Peppa loves Suzy.

212
00:09:49,319 --> 00:09:51,319
Suzy loves Peppa.

213
00:09:51,319 --> 00:09:52,839
They are best friends.

214
00:09:52,839 --> 00:09:56,079
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

215
00:09:56,079 --> 00:09:59,199
[BOTH GIGGLE]

216
00:09:59,199 --> 00:10:02,120
Peppa, why don't you and Suzy
go and play in your bedroom?

217
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:04,160
[SNORTS]
Yes, Mommy!

218
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:06,319
SUZY: Baa!
[PEPPA GRUNTS]

219
00:10:06,319 --> 00:10:08,160
NARRATOR:
George wants to play too.

220
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:11,000
[GIRLS LAUGHING]

221
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:16,560
NARRATOR:
Peppa and Suzy love playing
in Peppa's bedroom.

222
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,439
So does George.

223
00:10:21,439 --> 00:10:23,360
[LAUGHS, GRUNTS]

224
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,920
No, George.

225
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:28,560
This game is just
for big girls.

226
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:31,560
[SNORTS]
Go and play with
your own toys.

227
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:36,319
NARRATOR:
Peppa and Suzy want
to play on their own.

228
00:10:36,319 --> 00:10:38,640
I'm a tiny little
fairy princess.

229
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,800
[GRUNTS]

230
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:44,520
[SNORTS, GRUNTS]

231
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:47,920
[GIGGLES]

232
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:52,160
[GRUNTS]
I'm going to wave
my magic wand, ha, ha!

233
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:54,240
And turn you into
a frog!

234
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,360
[SCREAMS]
[BOTH LAUGHING]

235
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:59,040
NARRATOR:
George doesn't like
playing on his own.

236
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:01,079
[GIRLS LAUGHING, SHOUTING]

237
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,640
NARRATOR:
George wants to play too.

238
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:08,160
No, George!

239
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:10,240
I'm playing with Suzy.

240
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:13,839
You have to play
somewhere else.

241
00:11:13,839 --> 00:11:17,280
NARRATOR:
George wants to play with
Peppa. He feels a bit lonely.

242
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,520
George, I need some help!

243
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:21,959
I'm making
chocolate chip cookies!

244
00:11:21,959 --> 00:11:23,560
[♪♪♪]

245
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,839
[GRUNTS]

246
00:11:25,839 --> 00:11:28,000
Someone needs to
lick out the bowl.

247
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,680
[GRUNTS, LAUGHS]

248
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:31,360
[SLURPING]
NARRATOR: George likes

249
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:33,719
helping Mommy make cookies.

250
00:11:33,719 --> 00:11:35,439
[GIRLS GIGGLING]

251
00:11:35,439 --> 00:11:37,680
NARRATOR:
But he likes playing
with Peppa more.

252
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:39,400
[♪♪♪]

253
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,800
[GRUNTS, LAUGHS]

254
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:43,480
Baa, I want to be a nurse!

255
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:46,480
[SNORTS]
I want to be a doctor.

256
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,800
