Oh, I see.

278
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:51,079
Can the patient have
a visitor?

279
00:12:51,079 --> 00:12:53,400
Just for a little while.

280
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:56,000
He might get tired.

281
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:58,120
