to make him feel better.

284
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:06,120
[GRUNTS, LAUGHS]

285
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:09,760
[CRUNCHES]

286
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:13,400
Um, excuse me, Doctor,
can you help me?

287
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:15,719
