288
00:13:15,719 --> 00:13:18,599
Hee, hee, that tickles!
[SNORTS]

289
00:13:18,599 --> 00:13:20,280
[GURGLING]

290
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:21,599
[GIGGLES, SNORTS]

291
00:13:21,599 --> 00:13:23,800
