cookies to make me better.

295
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:32,520
[GIRLS GIGGLING]

296
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,079
[GRUNTS]
And me!

297
00:13:34,079 --> 00:13:35,839
[SNORTS]
And me!

298
00:13:35,839 --> 00:13:37,880
And me! Baa!

299
00:13:38,959 --> 00:13:42,040
[ALL CRUNCHING, LAUGHING]

300
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:50,959
