313
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:24,520
[GRUNTS]
Dine-saw?

314
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:28,680
[SNORTS, LAUGHS]
No, it's not a dinosaur.

315
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,920
[SNORTS]
Come and see.

316
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:34,839
[SQUAWKS]

317
00:14:34,839 --> 00:14:38,280
