Pretty Polly.

322
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,680
Ooh.
Wow!

323
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:55,360
I'm a clever parrot.

324
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:58,199
[SQUAWKS]
I'm a clever parrot.

325
