330
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:09,640
Hello, Polly.

331
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,520
Hello, Polly.

332
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:13,479
What a sweet
little parrot!

333
00:15:13,479 --> 00:15:15,560
What a sweet
little parrot!

334
