373
00:17:11,639 --> 00:17:16,919
I'm a noisy parrot!
[SNORTS]

374
00:17:16,919 --> 00:17:20,280
I'm a noisy parrot!
[SNORTS]

375
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,399
[BOTH LAUGHING]
[SQUAWKING, LAUGHING]

376
