[GRUNTS]

378
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:35,080
Polly is such a sweet parrot.

379
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:37,399
Yes, Granny.

380
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,919
I'm a clever parrot.

381
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:46,720
I'm a noisy parrot!
[SNORTS]

382
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,760
I'm a noisy parrot!

